sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor p0 as client
    participant p1 as shop.oms
    participant p2 as oms-pg
    participant p3 as bus
    p0->>p1: CancelOrder → CancelOrderResponse
    p1->>p2: by_id
    alt order.status is Status::Cancelled
    else otherwise
        p1->>p2: save
        p1-)p3: OrderCancelled
    end
    p1->>p2: by_id
